    <title>Useful</title>
    <updated>2026-10-22T00:51:57Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">A loose chair rung can often be steadied with wood glue: clean the joint, work glue into the gap, then clamp it until fully dry.</div>
    </content>
