  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#b03c13671d3029a586ee7a45d8fe764c12bf7394f66ba6a7e2a5187b14ea78ac</id>
    <title>Hopeful</title>
    <updated>2026-10-22T00:51:57Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-2" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Mosses can dry out and look lifeless, then resume growing when rain returns; their resilience helps them thrive where many plants cannot.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
